<title>UK: CLF Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up Nov 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>CLF Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up Nov 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CLF HYPOTHEKENBANK BERLIN</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.25	MATURITY    05.NOV.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    05.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING    BERLIN</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO 05.NOV.97 THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR STEPS-UP TO</p>
<p>		5.50 PCT.</p>
<p>DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 562</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
